# Copy to .env.local and fill in values

# Optional: Travelpayout Tech Solutions (Content Analytics, LinkSwitcher, Emerald)
# Get the script URL from: https://app.travelpayouts.com/tools → your Project → Install & Activate
# The script is unique per Project. Copy the full script tag, then extract the src URL.
# Example: if you get <script src="https://s.tpcdn.net/xxx/script.js"></script>, use:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TRAVELPAYOUT_SCRIPT_SRC=https://s.tpcdn.net/xxx/script.js
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TRAVELPAYOUT_SCRIPT_SRC=
